      "parameters": {
        "color": "#344B35",
        "width": 2016,
        "height": 848,
        "content": "# Part 2 \u2014 Ingest new file\n\nGoogle Drive Trigger fires on a new file:\n\n1. Downloads the PDF.\n2. Extracts text from the document.\n3. Chunks and embeds the content.\n4. Upserts vectors into Supabase."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "22c57f7f-c81f-45b3-9cb5-8eafe69fa8a3",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2448,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#5B569F",
        "width": 2016,
        "height": 800,
        "content": "# Part 3 \u2014 Update existing file\n\nGoogle Drive Trigger fires on a modified file:\n\n1. Deletes existing vectors for this file from Supabase first (matched by file ID in metadata).\n2. Re-ingests and indexes the new version using the same pipeline."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "338aef2b-9562-4274-a256-7aadebdee88d",
