      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#9A5151",
        "width": 2016,
        "height": 640,
        "content": "# Part 4 \u2014 Delete a file\n\nGoogle Drive Trigger fires when a file is removed:\n\n1. Removes all matching vectors from Supabase.\n2. Cleans up the Drive entry.\n3. Keeps the knowledge base fully in sync."
